{"steam_appid":3205630,"steam_name":"Arcane Ascent","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3205630/1512627805/16d2b57bf99bd2c3e9250bcd5c3b283c062dcc75/1783637256/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1783637843","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257373281/6016d7e5e7875033368032b42a9447da3ecf5249/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1783637843","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205630/7d1368072ce8fcaa371f030932bae5e29d95e469/ss_7d1368072ce8fcaa371f030932bae5e29d95e469.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784757038","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205630/b2e7ad2149aa542f1fa5289d265ba1ba0c8529a4/ss_b2e7ad2149aa542f1fa5289d265ba1ba0c8529a4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784757038","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205630/b165745aa7af5e434014172dc29736efcc93ef1c/ss_b165745aa7af5e434014172dc29736efcc93ef1c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784757038","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205630/377721d5e0463c2cb4af98ab9b8a0153cf3141ac/ss_377721d5e0463c2cb4af98ab9b8a0153cf3141ac.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784757038","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205630/2d115ad41b5ea9ec562e7fe8c0e7ba9423610507/ss_2d115ad41b5ea9ec562e7fe8c0e7ba9423610507.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784757038"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FORGE YOUR DESTINY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision changes the adventure. Every elemental gate you pass through will alter the creatures, events, rewards, and final boss. As you ascend the Arcane Tower, you will be the one to shape the ultimate enemy. Build a powerful spell deck, craft artifacts through alchemy, and adapt your strategy to overcome the challenge you yourself have forged.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205630/extras/410ee2a83689b6880cbf755c17c7eeef.poster.avif?t=1784757038\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205630/extras/410ee2a83689b6880cbf755c17c7eeef.webm?t=1784757038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205630/extras/410ee2a83689b6880cbf755c17c7eeef.mp4?t=1784757038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATES POWERFUL COMBOS AND UNIQUE STRATEGIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each wizard will have his own combat style and multiple ways to defeat the enemies. Play your cards right and design your strategy to reach the top.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205630/extras/9ca46a428d4ea953105cd0d8f9e682fc.poster.avif?t=1784757038\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205630/extras/9ca46a428d4ea953105cd0d8f9e682fc.webm?t=1784757038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205630/extras/9ca46a428d4ea953105cd0d8f9e682fc.mp4?t=1784757038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEARN AND IMPROVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every defeat is just the beginning. Use the resources you’ve gathered from your failed attempts to forge relics of unimaginable power and challenge the tower once again. Unleash chaos by summoning demons, wield weapons of immense power, reconstruct the grimoires of ancient mages, and unleash the power of forbidden artifacts from hidden deities. The tower awaits you...  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205630/extras/c436c40bb9e1710620bfd71d0f1f6489.poster.avif?t=1784757038\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205630/extras/c436c40bb9e1710620bfd71d0f1f6489.webm?t=1784757038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205630/extras/c436c40bb9e1710620bfd71d0f1f6489.mp4?t=1784757038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205630/extras/a97feb706bd8e952136753765d502050.poster.avif?t=1784757038\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205630/extras/a97feb706bd8e952136753765d502050.webm?t=1784757038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205630/extras/a97feb706bd8e952136753765d502050.mp4?t=1784757038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EACH FORAY INTO THE ARCANE TOWER IS UNIQUE AND EXCITING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The use of procedures, encounters with NPCs, events, card combinations along with the variety of enemies and bosses will make each game feel unique and refreshing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205630/extras/6efa40224982dab5874372bab7e31f1c.poster.avif?t=1784757038\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205630/extras/6efa40224982dab5874372bab7e31f1c.webm?t=1784757038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205630/extras/6efa40224982dab5874372bab7e31f1c.mp4?t=1784757038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1gb VRAM, OpenGL 3.0 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie","RPG"],"developers":["Catbot Games"],"publishers":["Word Games"],"release_date":"Jul 10, 2026"}